<title>INDONESIA: Steady Safe says 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Steady Safe says 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>				  (in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net revenues			 149.86    vs     105.79</p>
<p>    Net income			    48.02    vs	35.21</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	230     vs	 169</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 79.28    vs	 58.31</p>
<p>    Income from operations	   59.83    vs	 45.43</p>
<p>    Other income			 (7.06)   vs	 (3.67)</p>
<p>    Minority interest		  (3.89)   vs	 (5.42)</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  54.77    vs	 39.97</p>
<p>Note: The results were audited. PT Steady Safe is a transportation firm.</p>
</text>
